{%- comment -%}
  A small round swatch for an option value with Shopify swatch data (colour or image, set on the product's option
  values or through the category's colour metafield). Prints nothing when the value has none, so text pills stay
  as they are. Params: value (product_option_value), class (optional extra class).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if value.swatch.image -%}
  <i class="mu-sw{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}" style="background-image: url({{ value.swatch.image | image_url: width: 64 }})" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{%- elsif value.swatch.color -%}
  <i class="mu-sw{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}" style="background-color: {{ value.swatch.color }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{%- endif -%}
